  "notes": "Mac mover trial A, 2026-09-24, mechanics-only (protocol mover-early-entry-v1-20260924 paper_e2e: nothing validated, so the candidate is the most-traded development rule, 10:00|G0.20|V250000|any). Deviations: the scan runs after 10:00 (at trial start, about 12:50 ET), so the snapshot prefilter uses the latest trade then; entries are at trial start instead of 10:00; exit X2 (60 minutes after the first fill) replaces the candidate's X1 because the engine bounds a hold at about 70 minutes. All caps are config-mover.json's."
